 "remarks": "Overlooking Mill River Park, this bright, well-maintained 1-bedroom condo sits in the heart of downtown. Updated flooring and a functional, light-filled layout make it easy to settle in, and an in-unit washer and dryer plus garage parking add everyday convenience. Head up to the rooftop sun deck to enjoy sweeping views, picnic tables, and a relaxing spot to unwind or entertain. Everything is walkable, from Mill River Park and UConn Stamford to countless restaurants and shops, and commuters will appreciate quick access to the Metro-North train station, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway. The unit is currently leased through December 2026 at $2,100/month, so you can plan a move-in for early 2027 or hold it as an income-producing investment. A great opportunity to own in one of downtown's most convenient locations.",
